 BEYOND THE MAIN SEED
 Weak RNG also hit paper-wallet keys, clone / Key Teleport material, and some Secure Notes passwords — even when the BIP-39 seed itself came from dice (WizardSardine / Block).
 LOWER RISK
-At least 50 private dice rolls at seed creation. A long truly random BIP-39 passphrase (not the device PIN) may buy time, but weak passphrases are not enough — BTC Sessions reported a confirmed Mk3 drain with a two-word passphrase. CK tripwire is mapping live how far added dice/passphrase entropy currently stops sweeps (zero-entropy control swept in ~1h; low-band honeypots still live as of Aug 4). Still migrate when practical.
